{"id":"7a65e2eeba9919f8","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard.md","title":"标准归约必为平行标准","display":"lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard — 标准归约必为平行标准","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard","aliases":["56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard"],"display":"lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard — 标准归约必为平行标准","depends_on":["[[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]"],"source_section":"§8.5 Lemma 8.5.43; Proposition 8.5.44","source_printed_pages":"379","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; orthogonal-specialization","source_proof_status":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard — 标准归约必为平行标准"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a406ab9d156c983d\" href=\"?note=a406ab9d156c983d\" title=\"56-df-standard-labelled-reduction\">56-df-standard-labelled-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.5 Lemma 8.5.43; Proposition 8.5.44"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"379"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; orthogonal-specialization"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R,\\operatorname{par}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R,\\operatorname{par}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a406ab9d156c983d\" href=\"?note=a406ab9d156c983d\" title=\"56-df-standard-labelled-reduction\">56-df-standard-labelled-reduction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Std}_R(\\rho)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{PStd}_R(\\operatorname{par}_R(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Std}_R(\\rho)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{PStd}_R(\\operatorname{par}_R(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定位置p。首次在文本序不右于p收缩的步若存在，由Std其模式必须包含p，故其根q是p的前缀。在该步前不存在根为p前缀的步，否则那一步更早满足文本序条件；所以它也是首次位于p上方或同位的步。此即PStd。若没有首次文本序左方步，则也没有上方步，PStd条件真空成立。书中命题的正交具体路径特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-standard-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"a406ab9d156c983d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-standard-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"a406ab9d156c983d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R,\\operatorname{par}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R,\\operatorname{par}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Std}_R(\\rho)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{PStd}_R(\\operatorname{par}_R(\\rho)).","display":true}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard.md]]"},{"id":"efe12b141b93e7e9","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\approx_R$ 分别取 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的具体归约见证与置换等价。有限证明项的归约化见 [[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]，SR测度及其良基性见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；标准路径的单元素平行化保持标准性见 [[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard]]。"}],"outgoing":["a406ab9d156c983d"]}